  unitName: Leshy
  unitId: 30052
  unitNumber: 520
  description: An animal-like plant that lives deep in the forest. They like humid
    places and will eat anything that fits in their mouth. They are feared as protectors
    of the forest as they live deep within and are rarely ever encountered by humans.
    However, as scary as they may look, out of kindness they give fruits to starving
    travelers. Apart from that, should anyone cause harm to the forest they release
    an aroma throughout the forest which changes the personality of all its creatures
    and makes them attack aggressively.
  summonDesc: I am Leshy.<br>You're a Summoner, are you not?<br>I wonder if I should
    go with you.
  fusionDesc: I still hunger, Summoner.<br>Give me more of that.<br>Please, hurry.
  evoDesc: Did I scare you, Summoner?<br>There's no need to get defensive,<br>it's
    just me.
  element: 3
  rarity: 2
